      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنصحهُ</span></b> , (S, L,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتصحهُ</span></b> , (L,)
<i>He reckoned him,</i> or <i>deemed him,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نصِيحَ</span>, (S, L,)
i. e., <i>a sincere, faithful,</i> or <i>honest, adviser,</i> or
<i>counsellor,</i> or <i>actor.</i> (L.)

